  "why": "owner-proxy ruling Q1 (Fable, 2026-11-17): when blocked, a jump outranks the dash. Policy v2 (tools/leg_drive.py _Moving) starts a dash only on a tick that is not blocked; the moving family (spindash, diagfall, topspeed) is v2, so these v1 recordings are superseded. Kept, never overwritten or deleted."
